ld-have-access\",\"admin-user-roles\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0042\",\"verdict\":\"already_covered_indirectly\",\"suggestedAction\":\"link_existing_candidate\",\"reason\":\"Introduces the login screen as the start of app structure walkthrough, already covered by the login requirement.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"login-only-no-self-registration\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0046\",\"verdict\":\"already_covered_indirectly\",\"suggestedAction\":\"link_existing_candidate\",\"reason\":\"States the planned profile subpages About Me, Communication, Video, and Calendar, all of which are already represented by existing feature candidates.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"about-me-page\",\"communication-page-verbal-nonverbal\",\"video-support-for-scenarios\",\"calendar-medication-feature\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0047\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Adds concrete content and ordering details for the About Me page, including hobbies, names, age, pictures with descriptions, plus-button, and newest-first ordering.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"about-me-page\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0048\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Adds interaction detail for About Me content creation via a separate add window and newest-first display, which supports the About Me feature design.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"about-me-page\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0049\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Provides concrete structure for the communication section: split into verbal/nonverbal, separate navigation targets, and plus-button-based expansion with text or image entries.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"communication-page-verbal-nonverbal\",\"visual-not-text-only\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0050\",\"verdict\":\"already_covered_indirectly\",\"suggestedAction\":\"link_existing_candidate\",\"reason\":\"Merely transitions discussion to the calendar feature, which is already captured.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"calendar-medication-feature\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0051\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Adds detail for the calendar feature: simple month-day interaction, adding entries, and a medication list beneath.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"calendar-medication-feature\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0052\",\"verdict\":\"already_covered_indirectly\",\"suggestedAction\":\"link_existing_candidate\",\"reason\":\"Transitions discussion to the video page, already represented by the video feature candidate.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"video-support-for-scenarios\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0053\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Specifies the video page interaction model: add videos with descriptions via plus-button and show newest video first.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"video-support-for-scenarios\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0055\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Adds concrete UI behavior for the No-Go section and gives an example of a resident-specific no-go.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"no-go-page\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0059\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Raises the sensitivity of data and the need to address data protection, reinforcing the existing project-scope/privacy clarification candidates.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"privacy-not-in-depth-now\",\"records-access-limited-by-privacy\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0061\",\"verdict\":\"already_covered_indirectly\",\"suggestedAction\":\"link_existing_candidate\",\"reason\":\"Asks whether staff can see all profiles across facilities or only those in their own house, which is exactly the issue resolved by restricted cross-facility access.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"cross-facility-access-restricted\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0062\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Shows that cross-facility access handling was an open design question at that point, supporting the later access-control decision.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"cross-facility-access-restricted\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0065\",\"verdict\":\"already_covered_indirectly\",\"suggestedAction\":\"link_existing_candidate\",\"reason\":\"Raises the platform question iPhone vs Android, already covered by the cross-platform requirement.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"cross-platform-ios-android\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0077\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Explains why the app is valuable for new staff and first encounters, and adds that relatives could prefill data for new residents, supporting both onboarding and relatives' contribution.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"support-new-staff-onboarding\",\"relatives-should-have-access\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0081\",\"verdict\":\"already_covered_indirectly\",\"suggestedAction\":\"link_existing_candidate\",\"reason\":\"Introduces the idea of a dedicated resident account, which is already captured by the resident-account candidate.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"resident-account-own-profile-only\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0084\",\"verdict\":\"attach_as_evidence\",\"suggestedAction\":\"attach_evidence\",\"reason\":\"Provides rationale and concrete usage for search to simplify navigation across many profiles.\",\"suggestedProposition\":null,\"relatedCandidateIds\":[\"search-profile-and-communication\"]},{\"unitId\":\"AU-0085\",\"v